- @pg_title = 'Series Paintings'

h1 = @pg_title

markdown:
  When I work on a picture I try to dig into the original idea as deeply
  as I can, and I often end up with too much source material for a
  single piece. Then, I may create a series of paintings.

  This section of the site shows series of paintings, some of which are
  complete, others which are open-ended and ongoing.

